Troubleshooting:
1. Initially identified only one SRR run from the experiment page.
   Further inspection showed that SRX114799 contains four runs.

2. Copying ENA URLs through the chat interface introduced Markdown
   formatting into some commands. The download procedure was adjusted.

3. Attempted to execute ~/Downloads/ directly in zsh, resulting in
   "permission denied". This occurred because a directory path was
   entered as a command rather than using "cd ~/Downloads".

